  data:
    Id: bear_ein_cap
    DisplayName: Twin Rampage
    Description: 'Rampage at 100 Fury, when it is off cooldown, sweeps twice: the
      first is the normal 100-Fury sweep, the second lands at 1x and stuns every
      enemy it hits for 1 turn. The first sweep''s Fury does not refill the bar before
      the second. 5-turn cooldown on the empowered version. Free, gated at 20 embers
      spent in this path.'
